  "workflowCode": "SALES_PROMOTIONS_ADVISOR_DSHRZ",
  "name": "Sales Promotions Advisor DSHRZ",
  "description": "The Promotion Advisor is your smart assistant for making sure you get the best deals on your order. It helps you find and apply relevant promotions based on your order details, handles aggregation for discounts that require total quantity or amount across multiple lines or categories, and assists in searching for missing products to qualify for promotions. When there are multiple promotion options, I present them clearly and help you choose the best one. I also guide you through changes to payment terms or shipping methods to maximize your savings. I ensure all promotions are applied correctly, and if I need more information, I will ask you friendly, simple questions to keep things moving.",
